;   Shared drawing layer (scaffold).
;
;   First concrete piece: a horizontal fill primitive used by both enemy health
;   bars and the status HUD. It writes `count` copies of `tile` to the PPU data
;   port, assuming the caller has already set the destination address via $2006.
;
;   IN:  A = tile to fill with
;        X = number of bytes to write
;   OUT: none
;   USES: none (A/X preserved? no -- X is consumed)
;
;   Written by us. Eurocom's source is read-only and pinned; see README.md.

        org $faff
drawfill cpx #0
        beq drawfill_done
drawfill_loop sta $2007
        dex
        bne drawfill_loop
drawfill_done rts
